      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "REGAL GALA (7) brings some strong form from Victoria including a last-start second to unbeaten colt Verbici in the Group 1 Redwood Classic. That was from the standing start like this race is and he won the previous time he raced under those conditions. Strong claims. SUNDAY SWEET TALK (9) has made the perfect start to her career, winning all four starts at this circuit and distance and from standing starts. Overcame a 30m handicap last time. Big chance to keep her perfect record intact. IM FRANKEE (4) is consistent having coming from 40m handicaps to place behind SUNDAY SWEET TALK in her last four starts. She will relish a return to the front mark having won at this circuit and distance the last time she started from there. BENNY NZ (8) hasn't raced since July but was readied with two trials. Include.",
